{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
    "name": "mini-gateway",
    "description": "业务网关 OAuth2 Bearer (JWT HS256) + API Key；管理面 HMAC POST /admin/gw/v1。\n\n**导入**：Postman → Import → 选择 `mini-gateway.postman_collection.json` 与 `mini-gateway.postman_environment.json`，右上角启用 Environment **mini-gateway local**。\n\n**网关**：`GATEWAY_AUTH_MODE=both`（或 bearer）、`OAUTH2_JWT_SECRET` 与环境变量 `oauth2_jwt_secret` 一致。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "/** @namespace mini-gateway Postman helpers */",
          "b64urlJson = function (obj) {",
          "  const s = JSON.stringify(obj);",
          "  const w = CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(s);",
          "  return CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(w)",
          "    .replace(/=+$/, '')",
          "    .replace(/\\+/g, '-')",
          "    .replace(/\\//g, '_');",
          "};",
          "",
          "signHs256Jwt = function (payload) {",
          "  const secret = pm.environment.get('oauth2_jwt_secret') || 'oauth2-dev-secret';",
          "  const h = b64urlJson({ alg: 'HS256', typ: 'JWT' });",
          "  const p = b64urlJson(payload);",
          "  const input = h + '.' + p;",
          "  const sig = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(input, secret);",
          "  const es = CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(sig)",
          "    .replace(/=+$/, '')",
          "    .replace(/\\+/g, '-')",
          "    .replace(/\\//g, '_');",
          "  return input + '.' + es;",
          "};",
          "",
          "buildJwtPayload = function (kind) {",
          "  const now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
          "  const skew = parseInt(pm.environment.get('oauth2_clock_skew_sec') || '60', 10);",
          "  let payload;",
          "  if (kind === 'valid_client') {",
          "    payload = { sub: 'svc-account', client_id: 'client-mini-gateway-01', exp: now + 3600 };",
          "  } else if (kind === 'expired') {",
          "    payload = { sub: 'test-user-expired', exp: now - skew - 120 };",
          "  } else {",
          "    payload = { sub: 'test-user-valid', exp: now + 3600 };",
          "  }",
          "  const iss = pm.environment.get('oauth2_issuer');",
          "  if (iss) { payload.iss = iss; }",
          "  const aud = pm.environment.get('oauth2_audience');",
          "  if (aud && aud.indexOf(',') === -1) { payload.aud = aud; }",
          "  const scope = pm.environment.get('oauth2_required_scope');",
          "  if (scope) { payload.scope = scope.split(',')[0].trim(); }",
          "  return payload;",
          "};",
          "",
          "signAdminHmac = function () {",
          "  const secret = pm.environment.get('gateway_admin_secret') || 'admin-secret-2026';",
          "  const ts = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
          "  const nonce = pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}');",
          "  const raw = ts + ':' + nonce;",
          "  const sign = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(raw, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
          "  pm.environment.set('hmac_ts', ts);",
          "  pm.environment.set('hmac_nonce', nonce);",
          "  pm.environment.set('hmac_sign', sign);",
          "};"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Business API (GET /)",
      "description": "测试接口：`GET {{gateway_base_url}}/`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "JWT valid (HS256)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('jwt_access_token', signHs256Jwt(buildJwtPayload('valid')));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('X-Gateway-Auth oauth2', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Gateway-Auth')).to.eql('oauth2');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{jwt_access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway_base_url}}/",
            "description": "Payload: sub=test-user-valid, exp=now+3600（Pre-request 动态签发）"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
